7/3/25, 2:57:19 AM PDT: Tool Completed: run_shell_command with data: ["output": commit c077b039606e0725efa67e134b0d9ffe8367b954
Author: Keith Ballinger <keithballinger@google.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 3 02:42:34 2025 -0700

    feat(ipc): implement basic tool execution support in IPC server
    
    - Simplify IPC server to handle tool events from the model
    - Add proper tool execution via executeToolCall for manual tool requests
    - Handle ToolCallResponse events that come from the model
    - Fix TypeScript errors with proper type handling
    - Remove sendToolResponse approach that doesn't work with Turn
    
    Tools are now notified when requested by the model. The HUD can see when
    tools are being called, but automatic execution is not yet implemented.
    
    Next steps:
    - Implement auto-approval and execution of tools in IPC mode
    - Add tool approval flow for manual approval mode
, "name": run_shell_command, "success": 1]
